{
  "chapter_id": "CH018",
  "title": "Testimonies of Resurrection",
  "sections": [
    {
      "section_id": "SEC067",
      "title": "The Word That Could Not Fail",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "I remember prophesying to a young lady that she would not die, that she would live. Afterward the lady died. God cannot lie, and I held to what had been spoken over her even when the natural outcome seemed to contradict it entirely.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA269",
            "SRC007690",
            "SRC007696",
            "SRC007700",
            "SRC007708",
            "SRC007709"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007690",
            "SRC007696",
            "SRC007700",
            "SRC007708",
            "SRC007709",
            "SRC007731",
            "SRC007732"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA269"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000001",
          "provider_handle": "p1"
        },
        {
          "text": "They buried her, and they started digging the grave. Somehow, without any flyer, any hand bill, any radio announcement, a crowd gathered, and the Tribune newspaper was there as well. I don't know how news travels at times, but I noticed that nobody needed to be told. Only men who do abnormal things draw that kind of attention without any conventional means of spreading word.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA270",
            "SRC007714",
            "SRC007717",
            "SRC007718",
            "SRC007719",
            "SRC007720",
            "SRC007721",
            "SRC007723"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007714",
            "SRC007717",
            "SRC007718",
            "SRC007719",
            "SRC007720",
            "SRC007721",
            "SRC007723"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA270"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000002",
          "provider_handle": "p2"
        },
        {
          "text": "At the graveside the devil said to me, look around, see this crowd — your life and your ministry are over today. But God had said to me that she would live, and I asked myself, can God keep to his word? I held to what had been spoken rather than to what the devil pointed at in that crowd.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA271",
            "SRC007726",
            "SRC007727",
            "SRC007729",
            "SRC007730",
            "SRC007731",
            "SRC007732"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007726",
            "SRC007727",
            "SRC007729",
            "SRC007730",
            "SRC007731",
            "SRC007732"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA271"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000003",
          "provider_handle": "p3"
        },
        {
          "text": "I had learned how to pray for miracles: don't pray long prayers. Say a short prayer and stop. I was simply following the model of Jesus. So at that grave I prayed briefly, asking that her life return, and she came back looking fresh, and she spoke to me. It was later reported in the Tribune newspaper.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA272",
            "SRC007735",
            "SRC007737",
            "SRC007738",
            "SRC007740",
            "SRC007766",
            "SRC007779",
            "SRC007782",
            "SRC007787",
            "REF041",
            "SRC005422",
            "SRC005494",
            "SRC005594"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007735",
            "SRC007737",
            "SRC007738",
            "SRC007740",
            "SRC007766",
            "SRC007779",
