    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC068",
      "title": "Activation, Not Persuasion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Before I arrived, her body had already been prepared for burial. So I came not to produce something new out of nothing, but to release what God had already said. God said to Joshua concerning Jericho that as the people walked around the city, the wall would fall. Angels had already surrounded Jericho; they were just waiting for a sign, waiting for the shout, and then they pushed the wall down.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA273",
            "REF058",
            "SRC007841",
            "SRC007843",
            "SRC007845",
            "SRC007849",
            "SRC007851",
            "SRC007855",
            "SRC007856",
            "SRC007862",
            "SRC007863",
            "SRC007866"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007841",
            "SRC007843",
            "SRC007845",
            "SRC007849",
            "SRC007851",
            "SRC007855",
            "SRC007856",
            "SRC007862",
            "SRC007863",
            "SRC007866"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA273"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF058"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000005",
          "provider_handle": "p5"
        },
        {
          "text": "That same principle governs how we are to speak over sickness.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA273"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007841",
            "SRC007843",
            "SRC007845",
            "SRC007849",
            "SRC007856",
            "SRC007863",
            "SRC007866"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA273"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000006",
          "provider_handle": "p6"
        },
        {
          "text": "When you see a child who is sick at home, don't talk to the sickness. Don't talk to the demon. Learn to activate what God has already ordained by speaking directly to the person, the way Joshua's shout released what the angels were already prepared to do.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA274",
            "SRC007869",
            "SRC007871",
            "SRC007876",
            "SRC007877"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007869",
            "SRC007871",
            "SRC007876",
            "SRC007877"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA274"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000007",
          "provider_handle": "p7"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is a real fear that attaches to this: if something doesn't happen as spoken, you fear you have killed their child, or taken someone away from the faith they knew before. But believing God's word, even carrying that fear of being wrong or of harming someone's trust, is central to operating in resurrection power. You can't help God. Believe him. Believe him.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA275",
            "SRC007898",
            "SRC007899",
            "SRC007901",
            "SRC007951",
            "SRC007952",
            "SRC007953"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007898",
            "SRC007899",
            "SRC007901",
            "SRC007951",
            "SRC007952",
            "SRC007953"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA275"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000008",
          "provider_handle": "p8"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA273",
        "IDEA274",
        "IDEA275"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC007841",
        "SRC007843",
        "SRC007845",
