      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC069",
      "title": "When It Does Not Happen",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The boy died in church. He was dead in the church, with cotton in his nose and all of that. Rumors went around afterward that he had sold his soul to America. I said, go and bring him back. I said, Moussa, Jesus heals you now. He opened his eyes. He said, Brother Chris.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA276",
            "EX047",
            "SRC007907",
            "SRC007910",
            "SRC007918",
            "SRC007925",
            "SRC007929",
            "SRC007936",
            "SRC007939",
            "SRC007940"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007907",
            "SRC007910",
            "SRC007918",
            "SRC007925",
            "SRC007929",
            "SRC007936",
            "SRC007939",
            "SRC007940"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA276"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX047"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        },
        {
          "text": "But it does not always happen that way. A woman, pregnant, eight months, had food poisoning, and she died at the hospital. I prayed in tongues. I prayed. Nothing happened. I told the husband, I said, she's dead. Go and bury her.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA277",
            "EX048",
            "SRC008053",
            "SRC008068",
            "SRC008076",
            "SRC008079",
            "SRC008080",
            "SRC008083",
            "SRC008084"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008053",
            "SRC008068",
            "SRC008076",
            "SRC008079",
            "SRC008080",
            "SRC008083",
            "SRC008084",
            "SRC008163",
            "SRC008164",
            "SRC008168",
            "SRC008169",
            "SRC008170"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA277"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX048"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000010",
          "provider_handle": "p10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterward I asked, Father, why didn't you resurrect the girl? Not every prayer for healing or resurrection succeeds. The outcome belongs to God, not to the failure of the one who prays.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA277",
            "SRC008163",
            "SRC008164"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008163",
            "SRC008164",
            "SRC008068",
            "SRC008080",
            "SRC008083",
            "SRC008168",
            "SRC008169",
            "SRC008170"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA277"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000011",
          "provider_handle": "p11"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA276",
        "IDEA277"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC007907",
        "SRC007910",
        "SRC007918",
        "SRC007925",
        "SRC007929",
        "SRC007936",
        "SRC007939",
        "SRC007940",
        "SRC008053",
        "SRC008068",
        "SRC008076",
        "SRC008079",
        "SRC008080",
        "SRC008083",
        "SRC008084",
        "SRC008163",
        "SRC008164",
        "SRC008168",
        "SRC008169",
        "SRC008170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC070",
      "title": "The Vessel, Not the Name",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Just be simple. When it doesn't happen, it's not your fault. You have done your part; let God do his part. The minister's role is to be an available, obedient vessel — nothing more is required, and nothing more should be claimed.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA278",
            "SRC008165",
            "SRC008168",
            "SRC008169",
            "SRC008170"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008165",
            "SRC008168",
            "SRC008169",
            "SRC008170",
            "SRC008196",
            "SRC008197",
            "SRC008198"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA278"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        },
        {
          "text": "The most dangerous thing is performance — making healing or miracles about reputation. God has to do it. People will know about our church, but what's your business in that? It's the church of Jesus Christ, not a platform for a minister's name.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA279",
            "SRC008179",
            "SRC008181",
            "SRC008183",
            "SRC008187",
            "SRC008189",
            "SRC008190"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008179",
            "SRC008181",
            "SRC008183",
            "SRC008187",
            "SRC008189",
            "SRC008190"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA279"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000013",
          "provider_handle": "p13"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's not your problem. Just be a vessel ready, a vessel ready to be used.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA278",
            "SRC008196",
            "SRC008197",
            "SRC008198"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC008196",
            "SRC008197",
            "SRC008198",
            "SRC008165",
            "SRC008168",
            "SRC008170"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA278"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000014",
          "provider_handle": "p14"
        }
      ],
